@startuml imp-c4-context
' C4 Level 1 — System Context — Import (IMP) context of Cordelê
title Cordelê — Import (IMP) — System Context

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #24608A
}

actor "Coordenador(a) Editorial\n(Marina — Editora Aetós)" as Editor

rectangle "Cordelê Platform\n(modular monolith)" as Monolith {
  rectangle "Import (IMP)\nbounded context" as IMP #E8F0FE
  rectangle "Projects (PROJ)\ncontext" as PROJ
}

rectangle "Angular Frontend\n(cordele-web)" as FE
rectangle "BFF (NestJS)\nsingle entry point" as BFF
database "PostgreSQL 16\nschema-per-tenant\n(cordele_global + emp_<slug>)" as PG
rectangle "File Storage\n(local disk POC / S3 prod)" as Storage

Editor --> FE : uploads .docx/.md (T03)\nreviews structure (T04)
FE --> BFF : HTTPS (OAuth2 JWT)
BFF --> IMP : POST /api/imp/manuscripts\n(synchronous parse)
IMP --> PROJ : in-process port\n(create/validate ProjetoEditorial)
IMP --> PG : persist immutable Manuscrito\n(tenant schema)
IMP --> Storage : store binary + extracted images\n(tenant-scoped keys)
IMP ..> PROJ : ManuscriptImported (in-process event)

note bottom of IMP
  No broker, no TechLab AI, no hub.
  Deterministic parse (mammoth/remark).
  Content is sacrosanct; unparsed segments preserved.
end note
@enduml
